ta can be found here : https://sites.google.com/view/fiqa/home PhraseBank dataset , by adding a fully - connected layer to the output of pre - trained language model .Since our data , Financial PhraseBank suffers from label imbalance ( almost 6 0 % of all sentences are neutral ) , this gives another good measure of the classification performance .For
