ilored for financial NLP tasks, specifically sentiment analysis. ; BERT-based language model tailored for financial NLP tasks, evaluated on sentiment classification. ; A BERT-based language model tailored for financial NLP tasks, specifically sentiment analysis, created by further pre-training BERT on a financial corpus and fine-tuning it for sentiment analysis.\n', 'Name:BERT\nDescription:Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, a pre-trained language model that serves as the foundation for FinBERT. ; A language model consisting of Transformer encoders, defining the language modeling task differently from ELMo and AWD-LSTM. It is trained on the "next sentence prediction" task. ; A language model consisting of a set of Transformer encoders, used for various NLP tasks. ; Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, a pre-trained language model. ; Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, a pre-trained language model. ; Bidirectional Encoder Representations from Transformers, a pre-trained language model used as a foundation for FinBERT.\n']split_entities: text_tokens=2804, instructions_tokens=500, budget_for_entities=6696, number_of_entities=65, avg_entity_tokens=46, max_entities=145, num_groups=1, entities_per_group=[65]
